  "description": "A small bar chart for counts and activity in metric cards or dense tables. Bars share a zero baseline and use semantic colors. Like Sparkline, it has no axes, animation, tooltip, or focus target; provide an accessible label describing the measurement and period. Reuses Sparkline’s bar renderer.",
  "exports": [
    "MiniBarChart"
  ],
